Sv","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T18:56:44Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T18:56:44Z","body":"Tested on redmi note 10.\r\n\r\n![IMG_20260305_213748_154_1](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee6d1729-ea54-4023-ace0-acd4bf2091cd)\r\n\r\nI pointed what exactly causes this problem.\r\n\r\nLooks like script editor menu also needs \"Collapse menu\" option. Or we need to do something with \"Open in Online Docs\" and \"Search help \" buttons – they may take really huge amount of space in some languages, and this problem is not platform-specific, so I think this problem should be addressed by tweaking these two buttons (actually I had half-working prototype addressing this, just need to finish it).\r\n\r\nAlso button making script editor floating does nothing on Android, right? So we can hide it to make script aditor a little narrower.\r\n\r\nAnother note – opening bottom tab may expand editor out of screen, so I think opening any buttom panel dock in vertical orientation mode should be disabled.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I think this feature makes writing code on phone extremely convenient compared to how it was before and it doesn't require feature proposal (there's simply nothing to discuss, this is straight win).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4007027887/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4007452027","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117109#issuecomment-4007452027","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117109","id":4007452027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7u3N17","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T20:07:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T20:07:22Z","body":"> Looks like script editor menu also needs \"Collapse menu\" option. Or we need to do something with \"Open in Online Docs\" and \"Search help \" buttons – they may take really huge amount of space in some languages, and this problem is not platform-specific, so I think this problem should be addressed by tweaking these two buttons (actually I had half-working prototype addressing this, just need to finish it).\r\n\r\n> Also button making script editor floating does nothing on Android, right? So we can hide it to make script aditor a little narrower.\r\n\r\nYeah, that's an issue. I think the \"Search Help\" button could be icon-only. It might be better to address this in a separate PR though because it would be a general change and might need more discussion.\r\nAlso this problem only affects smartphones; tablets should be fine. Also, the menu bar will be hidden when the keyboard opens, which reduces the impact.\r\n\r\nYes, the floating script editor button is not usable in single-window mode (Android editor runs in single-window mode), so it currently does nothing there. We can hide it.\r\n\r\nI'll send a PR to reduce the menu bar width. I'd like to keep this PR focused only on Android Editor specific changes.\r\n\r\n> Another note – opening bottom tab may expand editor out of screen, so I think opening any buttom panel dock in vertical orientation mode should be disabled.\r\n\r\nThat's true, but again this mainly affects smartphones and should be fine on tablets. For now, I'd prefer to keep it as it is, since some bottom tabs (like the filesystem for opening files) are useful. I'll try to make follow-up PRs to optimize bottom tabs so they work better in portrait mode.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4007452027/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4007562034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117109#issuecomment-4007562034","issue_url":"https://api.githu